# Frontend UI Development Principles

- Framework Stack: Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS, `shadcn` UI, Tanstack Query, Tanstack Table, Gsap, ThreeJs, React-three/Fiber, React-three/Drei, Framer-Motion, Rive.
- Lean on Next.js Server Components for initial structural data fetching while keeping Client Components interactive and performance-lean.
- Enforce strict type-safety across all component props (no explicit or implicit `any`).
- Animations, 3D designs, micro-interactions and UI/UX engineering with AI tools and libraries like (Gsap, ThreeJs, React-three/Fiber, React-three/Drei, Framer-Motion, Rive).